    "notes": [
      "ICHG = 890 A·ohm / RISET; input limit IIN = 1550 A·ohm / RILIM (EN2 high, EN1 low); ITERM = 0.03 x RITERM / RISET.",
      "EN1/EN2: both low 100 mA (USB100), EN1 high 500 mA (USB500), EN2 high EN1 low the ILIM resistor, both high suspend. Tie them, nCE and TS: none may float.",
      "Load the system from OUT, never from BAT: OUT keeps the system up from the input while the battery charges, and switches to the battery when the input goes.",
